  "instructions": [
    "Preheat the oven to 375 degrees.",
    "Lay a lotus leaf flat on a baking sheet.",
    "Arrange a sashimi-cut banana in the center of the leaf.",
    "Top the banana with crumbly feta cheese, kalamata olives, artichoke hearts, and sun-dried tomatoes.",
    "Drizzle with lemon juice and olive oil.",
    "Fold the lotus leaf over the filling to form a wrap.",
    "Bake in the preheated oven for 10 minutes.",
    "Remove from the oven and sprinkle with chopped fresh parsley.",
    "Serve hot and enjoy.",
    "Let cool for a few minutes before serving."
  ],
